OL,3,GNEWSA'It's cost upon cost for working
OL,4,Afamilies - they get no help'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamilies who earn just above the
OL,7,Fthreshold to miss out on benefits are
OL,8,Fstruggling with the cost of living and
OL,9,Fneed more help from the government, a
OL,10,Fcharity in the chancellor of the
OL,11,Fexchequer's constituency has said.
OL,13,FChancellor John Healey's Rawmarsh and
OL,14,FConisbrough constituency straddles
OL,15,FRotherham and Doncaster and within it,
OL,16,Faccording to Rotherham Council, the
OL,17,Fwards of Rawmarsh East and Rawmarsh
OL,18,FWest have deprivation levels well above
OL,19,Fthe borough and national averages.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
